{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32889","headline":"酬刘谷除夜见寄 · 李郢","name":"酬刘谷除夜见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"坐恐三更至，流年此夜分。\n客心无限事，愁雨不堪闻。\n灞上家殊远，炉前酒暂醺。\n刘郎亦多恨，诗忆故山云。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李郢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32889.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32889","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}